# Vein Ripper's "Whenever a creature dies" looks back in time (CR 603.10a; the card's ruling: "If Vein Ripper dies at the same
# time as one or more other creatures, its last ability triggers for each of those creatures"). Bot2's Wrath of God destroys the
# Ripper, Bot1's Memnite and Bot2's own Ornithopter at once: three triggers, each draining exactly 2, so Bot2 goes 20 to 14 and
# Bot1 20 to 26, though the Ripper is in the graveyard as they resolve.

